{%- liquid
  assign number_of_products = section.settings.related_count

  if recommendations.products and recommendations.products_count > 0
    assign related_collection = recommendations
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  This used to be wrapped in Shopify's stock <product-recommendations>
  custom element, which fetches this same section again via
  routes.product_recommendations_url and swaps its own JS-managed
  placeholder once/if that fetch resolves. That JS-driven layer is
  gone now — after two rounds of chasing an "invisible element still
  reserving space" bug inside it (most recently a hidden
  product-grid-item under .visually-invisible, which is only
  opacity:0 and never actually left layout), plain server-rendered
  Liquid is more reliable here and the fallback below already covers
  what that fetch was for anyway: recommendations.products is already
  populated directly on this render when Shopify has real ones for
  this product, with no extra fetch required, and the fallback covers
  every case where it doesn't.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="pm-homepage pm-product-recs">
  {{ 'pm-homepage.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  {{ 'pm-product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <div class="pm-product-recs-head">
    <span class="pm-eyebrow">Palera Milano</span>
    <h3 class="pm-serif">{{ section.settings.product_recommendations_heading }}</h3>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Shopify's dynamic ("related") recommendations need order/view
    history to have anything to suggest — a brand-new store, or a
    product with no sales yet, commonly gets zero back, which would
    otherwise leave this whole section blank forever. Falls back to a
    plain pull from Shop All (excluding the product being viewed)
    whenever that happens, so there's always something here — this
    quietly gets replaced by real recommendations once Shopify's
    engine actually has enough data to produce them, with no code
    change needed. related_collection is nil (not 0) when Shopify has
    nothing, and "nil == 0" is false in Liquid, so this has to check
    "unless > 0" rather than "== 0" to actually catch that case.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign display_products = related_collection.products -%}
  {%- unless related_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
    {%- assign display_products = collections.all.products -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
  {%- if display_products.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="pm-rec-grid">
      {%- assign shown_count = 0 -%}
      {%- for rec_product in display_products -%}
        {%- if shown_count >= number_of_products -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if rec_product.id != product.id -%}
          {%- assign shown_count = shown_count | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Sibling color count (the "+5" in the reference) — same
            title-prefix matching used on the Shop grid, since most
            colors here are separate products (e.g. "Maxi Roma —
            Black" / "Maxi Roma — Red"), not real variants.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign rec_color_option = nil -%}
          {%- for option in rec_product.options_with_values -%}
            {%- assign option_name_downcase = option.name | downcase -%}
            {%- if option_name_downcase == 'color' or option_name_downcase == 'colour' -%}
              {%- assign rec_color_option = option -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- if rec_color_option -%}
            {%- assign sibling_count = rec_color_option.values.size | minus: 1 -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign rec_base_title = rec_product.title | split: ' — ' | first -%}
            {%- assign sibling_count = 0 -%}
            {%- for sibling_product in collections.all.products -%}
              {%- if sibling_product.id != rec_product.id -%}
                {%- assign sibling_base = sibling_product.title | split: ' — ' | first -%}
                {%- if sibling_base == rec_base_title -%}
                  {%- assign sibling_count = sibling_count | plus: 1 -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          <a href="{{ rec_product.url }}" class="pm-rec-tile pm-reveal" style="transition-delay: {{ forloop.index0 | times: 70 }}ms">
            <div class="pm-rec-tile-image">
              {%- if rec_product.featured_image -%}
                <img src="{{ rec_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ rec_product.featured_image.alt | escape | default: rec_product.title }}" loading="lazy">
              {%- else -%}
                {% render 'pm-media-placeholder', label: 'Photo', hover: true %}
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            <div class="pm-rec-tile-info">
              <div class="pm-rec-tile-row">
                <span class="pm-rec-tile-name">{{ rec_product.title | split: ' — ' | first }}{%- if rec_product.title contains ' — ' -%} <span class="pm-tile-color">{{ rec_product.title | split: ' — ' | last }}</span>{%- endif -%}</span>
                {%- if sibling_count > 0 -%}
                  <span class="pm-rec-tile-colors"><i></i>+{{ sibling_count }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
              <span class="pm-rec-tile-price">
                {%- if rec_product.price_varies -%}From {{ rec_product.price | money }}{%- else -%}{{ rec_product.price | money }}{%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.product-recommendations.name",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "t:sections.product-recommendations.settings.show_product_recommendations.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "product_recommendations_heading",
      "label": "t:sections.product-recommendations.settings.product_recommendations_heading.label",
      "default": "You may also like"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "related_count",
      "label": "t:sections.product-recommendations.settings.related_count.label",
      "default": 8,
      "min": 2,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 1
    }
  ],
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["footer", "header", "custom.popups"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
